    "E": "broad horizontal opening with visible oral cavity and tongue; the maximum opening in this source belongs to this class",
    "O": "vertically rounded opening; strong frames form a tall oval rather than a broad horizontal cavity",
    "CLOSED": "lips meet or remain as a relaxed smile line without visible oral cavity"
